{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "45f1841087a16062",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "分布式 broker 20+ 个怎么选"
  },
  {
   "id": "c73c2858fc540fdc",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 80,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "已有评测：只测单机、只看性能、结论难泛化"
  },
  {
   "id": "6c4febff5efd18c8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 204,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "GQM 六维：性能/扩展/韧性/安全/扩展机制/易用"
  },
  {
   "id": "bc5b7b843314233d",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 284,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "StarlingX + K8s 边缘集群实测 EMQX/HiveMQ/VerneMQ"
  },
  {
   "id": "0d6ef8ee7ffe2687",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 432,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "对称 10 pub + 10 sub 场景，payload 150B，QoS 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "0d844c749d06918d",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 536,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "MST 判据：消费落后发布 > 100 msg/s"
  },
  {
   "id": "c6137a76b3d253c2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 616,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "崩溃注入：杀 broker 进程看重连补偿"
  },
  {
   "id": "bf4619f786851d27",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 740,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "MST：EMQX 28K / VerneMQ 10K / HiveMQ 8K msg/s"
  },
  {
   "id": "d9393fc96297e0bc",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 844,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "崩溃丢消息：HiveMQ 0 / VerneMQ 82 / EMQX 580"
  },
  {
   "id": "b5a3a73e73bd9a28",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 948,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "TLS 开销：EMQX 43% / VerneMQ 20%"
  },
  {
   "id": "50045ab4587df819",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 1052,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "可靠性参数：inflight 1000 + offline queue 50000"
  },
  {
   "id": "7f481050557cc328",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 1200,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "任务6 方法学：梯度加压/重复 3 次/95%CI/双源验证"
  },
  {
   "id": "02fe15c5d44a6898",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 1304,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "崩溃判读三特征：重连耗时/补偿段/恢复基线"
  },
  {
   "id": "eeca31eb4092bf7e",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 1384,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "autoscaling 只对新增连接生效（坑）"
  },
  {
   "id": "09b7493345aadd28",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 1508,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "Ubuntu：docker 部署 EMQX 做对照组"
  },
  {
   "id": "592f7ca65eea2c67",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 1588,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "HAProxy TCP 健康检查做 broker 切换"
  },
  {
   "id": "50a9ee6fcfa06968",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 1692,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "kill -9 注入崩溃 + 持久会话验收"
  },
  {
   "id": "d4f38e3216dc7cb2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 791,
   "width": 310,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "# 分布式IoT边缘MQTT代理对比\nKoziolek et al.\nECSA 2020\nGQM 六维集群实测"
  },
